emon2influx-parser
Copyright 2026 Arno Broeders

This product is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

It parses P1 smart-meter telegrams from the EMON kits of the SmartMeter DIY project of
the Lectoraat Smart Energy (MNEXT, Avans Hogeschool and HZ University of Applied Sciences)
and writes them to InfluxDB.

